<title>USA: TABLE- General Chemical's Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE- General Chemical's Q2 net rises.</headline>
<text>
<p>HAMPTON, N.H., July 30 (Reuter)</p>
<p>Three months ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.77		    $0.33</p>
<p> Net			   17.3			7.0</p>
<p> Revs			 165.0		    160.1</p>
<p> Avg shrs		    22.4		     21.5</p>
<p>Six months</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.27		    $0.79</p>
<p> Net			   29.0		     16.4</p>
<p> Revs			 314.5		    304.7</p>
<p> Avg			   22.8		     20.6</p>
<p>(All data above in millions except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: General Chemical Group Inc's 1996 earnings include a $7.6 million after-tax charge, or $0.35 a share, for management incentive programs.</p>
<p>The outstanding share figures include common stock equivalent shares related to restricted stock programs and outstanding stock options.</p>
